<p>On casting Entropic Gift, a radius 1 rift in spacetime will be opened underneath the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> turns, increasing in radius by 1 each turn to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 2, 2.</acronym></p><p>All caught within the rift are pulled towards the center and take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">9.87, 13, 16, 18, 20</acronym> darkness and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">9.87, 13, 16, 18, 20</acronym> temporal damage, plus <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15%</acronym> of your total entropy each turn (currently 0).</p>